Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.67,0:00:43.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu, nu am reușit să vorbesc deloc cu el.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:43.61,0:00:48.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fost foarte ocupat de când \Na devenit Comandantul Nordului.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:48.06,0:00:50.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine... Așa e Ikoma.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.63,0:00:53.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He tends to work too hard and get carried\Naway when he starts doing something.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:53.83,0:00:56.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu e făcut pentru \Ngenul ăsta de lucruri.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:56.78,0:00:59.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A spus că nu știe când se va \Nputea întoarce la stația Aragane.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:59.80,0:01:02.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar cum a rămas cu promisiunea noastră?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.63,0:01:04.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei... apropo...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:05.31,0:01:08.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai încercat trusa de machiaj pe \Ncare ți-am dat-o zilele trecute?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:08.31,0:01:09.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.51,0:01:11.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mi s-ar potrivi deloc.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:11.86,0:01:14.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta nu e adevărat.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:14.07,0:01:16.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nici măcar foarte ocupatul \NComandant al Nordului
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.43,0:01:18.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nu-și va putea lua ochii de la tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:19.44,0:01:21.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce tot spui acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.42,0:01:23.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna finish up my gun maintenance,\Nso I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.61,0:01:24.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai puțin...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:34.42,0:01:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar și dacă aș folosi-o...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.00,0:02:14.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:23.04,0:02:25.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kabane, they've clung to the outside of the train.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.42,0:02:27.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cinci...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.13,0:02:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu, șase.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.87,0:02:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will be troublesome if they change into other types.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.09,0:02:38.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Îi voi elimina în 30 de secunde.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:40.17,0:02:41.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Purificarea trupului și sufletului!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.70,0:02:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Încearcă să scape?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.57,0:02:59.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu te voi lăsa!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.03,0:03:17.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Douăzeci și sase de secunde...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.83,0:03:19.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bănuiesc că e decent.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.35,0:03:21.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mumei!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.45,0:03:24.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat?! \NCe a fost sunetul de mai devreme?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.06,0:03:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fost cumva un Kabane?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.89,0:03:28.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te-ai luptat cu el de una singură?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.86,0:03:30.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești bine?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.62,0:03:48.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K-K-Kabane? Uhm...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:48.30,0:03:51.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I uh... d-defeated the Kabane...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.22,0:03:58.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What have I... what have I done?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.95,0:04:00.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh, what?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:00.42,0:04:04.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... promised to turn you back into a human.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.18,0:04:05.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you I'd let you eat rice.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:06.52,0:04:09.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet I'm looking at you with feelings like these.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:10.24,0:04:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You damn idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:11.74,0:04:12.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You damn idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.82,0:04:14.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold up, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.82,0:04:16.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.27,0:04:21.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:21.26,0:04:22.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce este?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:23.79,0:04:24.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.73,0:04:27.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hei, ce s-a întâmplat?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:26.40,0:04:27.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:27.61,0:04:29.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sunteți bine?! Ikoma?! Mumei?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.50,0:04:30.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Voi intra!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hei, ce s-a întâmplat? \NLăsați-mă înăuntru!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:34.95,0:04:35.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Cum rămâne cu Kabaneul?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:35.95,0:04:38.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-am ocupat de el, nu intra aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:39.75,0:04:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt... așa un idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:41.81,0:04:43.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mai taci odată!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:43.02,0:04:44.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fir-ar! Fir-ar! Fir-ar!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:43.57,0:04:45.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ikoma! Ce s-a întâmplat?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.10,0:04:47.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am văzut-o pe Mumei...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.56,0:04:47.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}A pățit ceva Mumei?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:47.89,0:04:49.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt bine! Lăsați-mă în pace!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:49.89,0:04:52.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am văzut-o pe Mumei...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:53.04,0:04:54.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-am săturat!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.57,0:04:56.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt așa un idiot!
